`cone-rp` IS THE HEADLINE AND NOTHING ELSE IS. Both columns come from the SAME
   features, so it is the only comparison the recipe cannot inflate. Comparing
   a trained arm against the FSA bar is the mistake this project has made three
   times; the bar line above is context, not a comparator.
MECHANISM, cheaper than the headline: negm should fall from 43.7%, gapdiff should
   turn POSITIVE from -0.0101, erank should DROP. Accuracy moving while these do
   not means the stated mechanism is not what happened.
`conic` vs `sub` is the training-side test of non-negativity, mirroring exp38's
   read-out-side cone vs sub (-0.10 at k-means atoms, +0.60 at oPCA atoms).
TRANSFER: er_t0 vs er_rest. The loss sees cpt classes and serves n_cls; if rank
